{
  "key": 40580,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnChooseWhichHand",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How’s your Pokédex coming along?\r",
        "Me? I’m somewhere between fantastic\n",
        "and, uh, hopeless...\r",
        "But this isn’t about me!\n",
        "I’ve got something nice for you.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, choose which hand\n",
        "you want."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Salut, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Ça avance ton Pokédex?\r",
        "Moi? Ben, ça oscille entre le\n",
        "génial et, euh, le ridicule...\r",
        "Mais on n’est pas là pour parler de moi!\n",
        "J’ai un petit truc pour toi.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, choisis une main."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnYouWantTheVsSeeker",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: I see...\n",
        "You want the Vs. Seeker.\r",
        "I’m impressed, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "You know what’s important.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Je vois...\n",
        "Tu veux le Cherche VS.\r",
        "Tu m’impressionnes, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0},\n",
        "tu as l’esprit pratique.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnHaveThisTooThen",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Using that Vs. Seeker, you can\n",
        "find Trainers who want a rematch\f",
        "with you.\r",
        "Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, do you also have\n",
        "a Pokétch?\r",
        "Yup, you do.\n",
        "You can have this too, then.\r",
        "You deserve it for all your hard\n",
        "work, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: En utilisant ce Cherche VS, tu\n",
        "pourras localiser les Dresseurs qui\f",
        "veulent faire une revanche.\r",
        "Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, c’est une\n",
        "Pokémontre?\r",
        "Exact, c’est bien ça.\n",
        "Dans ce cas, je te donne aussi ceci.\r",
        "Tu as bien travaillé, c’est mérité,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnUseDowsingMachineOften",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: The {STRVAR_1 24, 1, 0} is\n",
        "something you should touch often.\r",
        "It will tell you if there is an item\n",
        "on the ground that you can’t see.\r",
        "I think there’s something here, even.\n",
        "You should try it out.\r",
        "OK, let’s keep working on our\n",
        "Pokédexes.\r",
        "Professor Rowan is counting on us!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: N’hésite pas à toucher le\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 24, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Il te préviendra s’il y a un objet\n",
        "invisible enfoui dans les environs.\r",
        "Tiens d’ailleurs, je crois bien qu’il y a\n",
        "quelque chose ici même. Essaye!\r",
        "Allez, on se remet au travail\n",
        "sur nos Pokédex.\r",
        "Le Professeur Sorbier compte sur nous!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasChooseAHand",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How’s your Pokédex coming along?\r",
        "Me? I’m always doing great!\n",
        "...I wish...\r",
        "But that’s not important.\r",
        "Lately, I’ve been experimenting with\n",
        "a couple of neat tools.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I’ll share with you.\n",
        "Choose a hand!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Ça se passe comment, ton Pokédex?\r",
        "Moi? Tout roule, comme d’habitude!\n",
        "... Enfin, pas tout à fait mais...\r",
        "Mais ce n’est pas très important.\r",
        "Je bidouille des outils vraiment\n",
        "classes ces derniers temps.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, je vais t’en faire\n",
        "profiter. Choisis une main!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasYouWantTheVsSeeker",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Oh yeah.\n",
        "You want the Vs. Seeker.\r",
        "Yup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you know what’s\n",
        "important.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Ouaiiiis!\n",
        "Tu veux le Cherche VS.\r",
        "Bien vu, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, tu ne\n",
        "perds pas le nord.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasHaveThisTooThen",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Using that Vs. Seeker, you can\n",
        "find Trainers who want to battle with\f",
        "you again.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, what about a Pokétch?\n",
        "Do you have one?\r",
        "Yup, you do.\n",
        "You can have this too, then.\r",
        "You deserve it for all of your\n",
        "effort, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Utilise le Cherche VS pour\n",
        "localiser les Dresseurs qui veulent\f",
        "prendre une revanche.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, tu connais la\n",
        "Pokémontre? Tu en as une?\r",
        "Oui, je vois ça.\n",
        "Dans ce cas, voilà un autre cadeau.\r",
        "Tu l’as bien mérité, tu as fait\n",
        "beaucoup d’efforts, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasTryTouchingDowsingMachine",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: The {STRVAR_1 24, 1, 0} is...\n",
        "Just try touching it.\r",
        "It’ll alert you if there is an\n",
        "unseeable item on the ground.\r",
        "Try it out now.\n",
        "I think there’s something here.\r",
        "OK, keep working on your Pokédex.\n",
        "Professor Rowan is counting on us!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Le {STRVAR_1 24, 1, 0}?\n",
        "Hum, essaie simplement de le toucher.\r",
        "Il t’indiquera quand un objet\n",
        "invisible est enfoui dans le sol.\r",
        "Essaye pour voir.\n",
        "Je crois qu’il y a quelque chose ici.\r",
        "Bien, surtout, travaille ton Pokédex.\n",
        "Le Professeur Sorbier compte sur nous!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_Dummy8",
      "garbage": 59
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_ThatSlopesTooSlippery",
      "en_US": [
        "That slope’s too slippery.\n",
        "You’ll need a Bike to get up.\r",
        "You don’t have a Bicycle?\n",
        "There’s a Cycle Shop in Eterna City."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cette pente est trop glissante. Il te\n",
        "faut une Bicyclette pour la monter.\r",
        "Tu n’as pas de Bicyclette? Il y a une\n",
        "Boutique de Vélo à Vestigion."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_ChangeGearTakeARun",
      "en_US": [
        "Change to the 4th gear and take a run.\n",
        "That’ll shoot you right up that slope."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Pour grimper la pente, change de\n",
        "vitesse et fonce."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SignMtCoronet",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 207\n",
        "Mt. Coronet"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Route 207\n",
        "Mont Couronné"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SignOreburghCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 207\n",
        "Oreburgh City"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Route 207\n",
        "Charbourg"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_TrainerTipsImmobilizedIfAsleepOrParalyzed",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "Pokémon may become immobilized if\n",
        "they are asleep or paralyzed.\r",
        "If it happens to your Pokémon,\n",
        "it could be disastrous.\r",
        "If your opponent’s Pokémon can’t\n",
        "move, it’s a big opportunity!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Conseils aux Dresseurs\r",
        "Les Pokémon endormis ou paralysés\n",
        "peuvent être immobilisés.\r",
        "Cela peut être extrêmement\n",
        "dangereux pour un Pokémon.\r",
        "Si le Pokémon de votre adversaire est\n",
        "immobilisé, c’est le moment de frapper!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}